{"speciesId":518,"names":{"fr":"Mushana","es":"Musharna","en":"Musharna","ja":"ムシャーナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La fumée qui sort de son front contient les rêves de nombreuses personnes et ceux de nombreux Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The mist emanating from their foreheads is packed with the dreams of people and Pokémon."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il peut matérialiser les rêves qu’il a mangés. La fumée qui sort de son front prend la forme des objets vus en rêve."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"With the mist from its forehead, it can create shapes of things from dreams it has eaten."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La fumée qui sort de son front contient les rêves de nombreuses personnes et ceux de nombreux Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Multitud de sueños de humanos y Pokémon se encuentran atrapados en el humo que despide por su frente."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The mist emanating from their foreheads is packed with the dreams of people and Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"おでこから 出ている 煙の 中には 人や ポケモンの 見た 夢が たくさん つまっているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"La fumée qui sort de son front change de couleur selon le contenu des rêves qu’il a mangés."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El color del humo que despide por su abultada frente varía según el contenido de los sueños que haya engullido."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"おでこから でる ゆめのけむりは 食べた 夢の 内容によって さまざまな 色に 変わるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La fumée qui sort de son front contient les rêves de nombreuses personnes et ceux de nombreux Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Multitud de sueños de humanos y Pokémon se encuentran atrapados en el humo que despide por su frente."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The mist emanating from their foreheads is packed with the dreams of people and Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"おでこから 出ている 煙の 中には 人や ポケモンの 見た 夢が たくさん つまっているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La fumée qui sort de son front change de couleur selon le contenu des rêves qu’il a mangés."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El color del humo que despide por su abultada frente varía según el contenido de los sueños que haya engullido."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"おでこから でる ゆめのけむりは 食べた 夢の 内容によって さまざまな 色に 変わるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est recommandé de ne pas l’approcher quand la fumée qui sort de son front a une teinte noire, sinon son cauchemar risque de se matérialiser."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando el humo que desprende es de un color negruzco, conviene no acercarse, ya que puede hacer realidad las pesadillas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When dark mists emanate from its body, don’t get too near. If you do, your nightmares will become reality."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"出てる 煙が 黒っぽいときは 近づかないほうが いいよ。 悪夢が 現実に なるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est sans cesse assoupi, plongé dans ses rêves. Il vaut mieux éviter de le déranger, car il est toujours mal luné au réveil."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Siempre está soñando o adormecido. Se pone de muy mal humor al despertar, por lo que es mejor no perturbarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It drowses and dreams all the time. It’s best to leave it be if it’s just woken up, as it’s a terrible grump when freshly roused from sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"いつも まどろみ 夢を 見ている。 寝起きは とっても 不機嫌に なるので そっとして おこう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":518,"moves":[{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hypnosis","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"defense-curl","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine"